message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Mass Appraisal of São Paulo Real Estate with TabPFN-3.5"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Benvenho"
    given-names: "Agnaldo Calvi"
    orcid: ""
    affiliation: "BP Avaliações e Perícias / IBAPE Nacional"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-27"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - mass appraisal
  - real estate valuation
  - TabPFN
  - tabular foundation models
  - spatial cross-validation
  - ITBI
  - "São Paulo"
abstract: >-
  Spatial machine-learning comparison (SAR, G-XGBoost, TabPFN-3.5) for mass
  appraisal on 82,187 actual transaction prices from the São Paulo
  real-estate transfer tax (ITBI), with spatial-block cross-validation,
  out-of-time testing on 2026 transactions, prediction intervals graded
  under the Brazilian appraisal standard NBR 14653-2, and traceable
  comparables. Prior Labs TabPFN-3.5 Hackathon entry.
references:
  - type: article
    title: >-
